<li id="bib.bib37" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhang et al. (2023)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Hanqing Zhang, Haolin Song, Shaoyu Li, Ming Zhou, and Dawei Song.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">A Survey of Controllable Text Generation Using Transformer-Based Pre-Trained Language Models.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib37.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">ACM Computing Surveys</em>, 56(3):1–37, 2023.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib38" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhang et al. (2025)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Jie Zhang, Haoyu Bu, Hui Wen, Yongji Liu, Haiqiang Fei, Rongrong Xi, Lun Li, Yun Yang, Hongsong Zhu, and Dan Meng.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">When LLMs Meet Cybersecurity: A Systematic Literature Review.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib38.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Cybersecurity</em>, 8(1):1–41, 2025.

</span></li>
      
